Package: zzworld
Title: WORLD Test Scoring and Edit Distance Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ronald G.", "Thomas", , "rgthomas@ucsd.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1686-4965"))
Description: Functions for analyzing WORLD test responses in cognitive assessments.
    Computes edit distance between patient responses and the target word "WORLD",
    supports multiple scoring methods, and integrates with MMSE (Mini-Mental State
    Examination) calculations. Useful for clinical research in cognitive assessment.
